			"Message": "style(Mountain): Compact import and macro formatting in PathCanon module\n\nConsolidate multi-line `use` statements and `dev_log!` macro invocations into single-line blocks within `Source/Cache/PathCanon/Cache.rs` and `SpawnDiagnosticLogger.rs`.\n\nThese stylistic adjustments reduce vertical whitespace in the PathCanon cache implementation and diagnostic logging logic. The changes maintain full functional equivalence while adhering to a more compact Rust formatting convention, ensuring the code remains readable without unnecessary line breaks for simple constructs.",
